<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fresenius started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fresenius started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities analyst Andrea Schaefer started coverage of dialysis company Fresenius Medical Care AG with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The dialysis industry provides extremely predictable, high-quality revenue streams driven by consistently strong patient base growth ... combined with the opportunity for consolidation and enhanced service mix,&quot; she wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 13/16 to 27 in mid-afternoon trade.  Germany's Fresenius AG holds a majority stake in the company.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
